    "description": "Never miss a moment on the campaign trail! RSBN brings you live election coverage like no one else in the media! Nothing clipped or cut here- we show you the full context of what is being said by the candidates so you can make up your own mind. Our coverage of political rallies and live events are second to none- you'll feel like you're actually there in person! Plus: Shows, Podcasts, and Breaking News delivered fresh daily!\r\n\r\nDisclaimer: Please note that the app contains old format movies and shows that may result in vertical letter boxing and lower video resolution on newer devices.",
